 🚀 Bonus: Fast Frequency Map (One-Liner Java 8 Style)


Map<Character, Long> freq = str.chars()
    .mapToObj(c -> (char)c)
    .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(c -> c, Collectors.counting()));


(But for now, stick with simple loops — one-liners look cool, but loops are easier to debug!)

